OL,3,ALocals honoured in Notting Hill Frieze
OL,4,Aexhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuests and celebrities specifically
OL,7,Fchosen for their contribution to the
OL,8,Farea's identity were photographed
OL,9,Fduring a live event on Friday and now
OL,10,Ffeature as part of the exhibition.
OL,12,FThe work is "about the community and
OL,13,Fbringing them into the art world and
OL,14,Finto my world," Endless said.
